<source category="XE" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="US-3808747-A"  status="new"><document-id status="new"  format="epo"><country>US</country><doc-number>3808747</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id> <sources><source category="A"  name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="US-4652469-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>US</country><doc-number>4652469</doc-number><kind>A</kind> </document-id> <sources><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources> </patcit><patcit ucid="US-4712333-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>US</country><doc-number>4712333</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1120195A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TSENG SHAOCHIEN</name><address><country>CN</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TSENG, SHAOCHIEN</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TSENG SHAOCHIEN</name><address><country>CN</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TSENG, SHAOCHIEN</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Abrasive medium consists of two half shells combined together with snaps, composed of protruding perimeter edge surrounding numerous holes on each shell surface. The medium element material and shape are determined by the material hardness and configuration of workpiece to be abraded, and the shape may be sphere, ellipse, cone or other curved shapes, consituted by numbers of protruding perimeter edges on the shell surface, to abrade by means of three-dimension vibratory such as tumbling in result of effective and quality workpiece finishing.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un support décapant puissant formé de deux demi-enveloppes combinées avec des boutons formés par de nombreuses protubérances ménagées sur les deux demi-enveloppes. Le matériau et la forme sont tributaires de la dureté du matériau et de la configuration de la pièce à décaper. La forme peut donc être sphérique, elliptique, conique ou courbée. Le matériau est formé de nombreuses protubérances pratiquées sur la surface de l'enveloppe de manière à décaper au moyen d'une vibration tridimensionnelle telle qu'un frottement, ce qui permet d'obtenir un décapage efficace et de qualité.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>